   DDeevviiccee nnooddeess
       Logical drives are accessed via the SCSI disk driver (_s_d), tape  drives
       via  the  SCSI  tape  driver (_s_t), and the RAID controller via the SCSI
       generic driver (_s_g), with device nodes named  _/_d_e_v_/_s_d*,  _/_d_e_v_/_s_t*,  and
       _/_d_e_v_/_s_g*, respectively.

