              The  host  _v_e_r_s_i_o_n attribute is a read-only attribute.  This at-
              tribute contains the driver version and the controller  firmware
              version.

              For example:

                  $ ccaatt //ssyyss//ccllaassss//ssccssii__hhoosstt//hhoosstt11//vveerrssiioonn
                  driver: 1.1.2-126
                  firmware: 1.29-112

